{"title":"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/632be376d0c3633262bc1084456a042b836246b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 1000 + 5 \\times 100 + 6 \\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"213\" height=\"15\" /> is equivalent to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50ca5c02f1ad0257b3e817bd5601ed3cddefa457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 656 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 6506 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 6056 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 60~506 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 6560$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"530\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d611bd8716a7a2dcf72724264d3773a6bc9fc6cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 1000 + 5 \\times 100 + 6 \\times 1 = 6000 + 5 \\times 100 + 6 \\times 1 = 6000 + 500 + 6 \\times 1 = 6000 + 500 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"731\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/a/33a88e9f6a9dac7a3c45f1ff9073f0f9454e6a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=6500 + 6 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 6506}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"195\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 CEMC Gauss 